There are very few tactics against that.  A low AC helps, but is 
no guarantee, of course.  Being displaced helps even more (one 
of the reasons I like displacement early in game), and to a 
lesser degree invisibility.  Having ESP and allowing the potential 
death-zappers no clear aim (push a powerful enough pet towards them 
and keep out of line of sight) sometimes helps a bit.  But still, 
reflection is a must before diving deeper, so I always hope for 
the amulet in Soko.  An emergency help might be a scroll of 
earth, if e.g. in such a situation 

